# samBar.com

> This website is a silly one made for people to ask me for advice. The name is actually my own name but shortened (except the '.com' obviously).

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

https://sambar-com.onrender.com/

---

## 📸 Screenshots

![alt text](screenshot.png)

---

## ✨ Features

- **Home page** — Landing page, and atmosphere
- **Bot integration** — Messages automatically received via configured telegram bot (`config_bot.php`)
- **Database-backed** — Dynamic content stored and retrieved from a database
- **Dockerized** — Easy to deploy anywhere with a single `docker-compose` command

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer      | Technology            |
|------------|-----------------------|
| Backend    | PHP                   |
| Database   | MySQL       |
| Server     | Apache (with `.htaccess`) |
| Container  | Docker                |
| Frontend   | HTML, CSS (Inter font) |

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
samBar.com/
├── Dockerfile
├── README.md
└── src/
    ├──screenshot.png      # Screenshot of main page
    ├── index.php          # Entry point
    ├── home.php           # Main home page
    ├── flame.php          # <!-- What does this page do? -->
    ├── sent.php           # Form submission handler
    ├── db.php             # Database queries
    ├── connection.php     # Database connection
    ├── config_db.php      # Database config (credentials)
    ├── config_bot.php     # Bot token & settings
    ├── .htaccess          # Apache rewrite rules
    ├── style.css          # Main stylesheet
    ├── style1.css         # Secondary stylesheet
    └── static/            # Font files (Inter)
```

---

## ⚙️ Installation & Setup

### Prerequisites

- [Docker](https://www.docker.com/) installed
- Or: PHP 8.x + Apache + MySQL installed locally

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<!-- your-username -->/samBar.com.git
cd samBar.com
```

### 2. Configure environment

Copy and edit the config files:

```bash
# Edit database credentials
nano src/config_db.php

# Edit bot token and settings
nano src/config_bot.php
```

**`config_db.php`** should contain:
```php
<?php
define('DB_HOST', 'localhost');
define('DB_NAME', 'sambar');
define('DB_USER', 'your_user');
define('DB_PASS', 'your_password');
```

**`config_bot.php`** should contain:
```php
<?php
define('BOT_TOKEN', 'your_bot_token_here');
define('CHAT_ID',   'your_chat_id_here');
```

> ⚠️ Never commit `config_db.php` or `config_bot.php` with real credentials. Add them to `.gitignore`.

### 3. Run with Docker

```bash
docker build -t sambar .
docker run -p 80:80 sambar
```

Or, if you have a `docker-compose.yml`:

```bash
docker-compose up -d
```

### 4. Run locally (without Docker)

Place the `src/` folder in your Apache `htdocs` or `www` directory, then import the database:

```bash
mysql -u root -p sambar < database.sql
```

