## 🌐 Deployment

The project includes a `Dockerfile` for easy deployment on any VPS or cloud provider.

```bash
# Build and run
docker build -t sambar .
docker run -d -p 80:80 --name sambar sambar
```

For production, make sure to:
- Use HTTPS (e.g., with [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/))
- Set up a reverse proxy (Nginx or Apache)
- Keep config files out of version control

